--- !u!114 &327053010
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 327053008}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1eff51274ff49ea4681ce0113fda63c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  manager: {fileID: 1565101086}
  companionToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
  conversation:
  - characterName: The Narrator
    characterIcon: {fileID: 1984562694116908507, guid: a646a087ceb466b408f80b040d1e0a28, type: 3}
    sentence: "Look, I\u2019ll make this quick. Use W, A, S, and D to move around.
      Try not to trip over your own feet, alright?"
  - characterName: The Narrator
    characterIcon: {fileID: 1984562694116908507, guid: a646a087ceb466b408f80b040d1e0a28, type: 3}
    sentence: Feeling fancy? Hold Q to open your Power Wheel. You can switch between
      the multiple characters you have recruited along your journey, each one has
      a special ability!
  - characterName: The Narrator
    characterIcon: {fileID: 1984562694116908507, guid: a646a087ceb466b408f80b040d1e0a28, type: 3}
    sentence: Once you've actually picked a power, hit Left Shift to let it rip.
      Just make sure you're pointing in the right direction.
  - characterName: The Narrator
    characterIcon: {fileID: 1984562694116908507, guid: a646a087ceb466b408f80b040d1e0a28, type: 3}
    sentence: And don't come crying to me when you're out of juice. Every move eats
      up your Powerup Tokens. No tokens, no magic tricks. Collect 'em or get used
      to walking.
  - characterName: The Narrator
    characterIcon: {fileID: 1984562694116908507, guid: a646a087ceb466b408f80b040d1e0a28, type: 3}
    sentence: I was thoughtful enough to add a respawn system, by pressing "R" you
      can come back to your last reached checkpoint and retry the level!
  - characterName: The Narrator
    characterIcon: {fileID: 1984562694116908507, guid: a646a087ceb466b408f80b040d1e0a28, type: 3}
    sentence: What are you waiting for, you are getting tips from a rock, go ahead
      and start your journey on mount Taygetus!
